SECTION 13 — 8-STEP PIPELINE (updated from v2)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

STEP 1: INGEST
  - Oracle pull: On-Account → Unbilled → Billed (this order)
  - GL Revenue (previous month) — pull at currency + entity level
  - Frequency: On-Account + Billed daily; GL monthly
  - Scoring data: Billed report monthly (confirmed)
  - Training data: 3 years collection history (updated)

STEP 2: VALIDATE
  - Dedup, date sanity checks, currency validation, zero-amount filter
  - Flag advance / leap invoices (is_advance_invoice = True)
  - Confirm Aetna invoice detection (by client_id match)

STEP 3: ENRICH (Client Rules Engine)
  - Apply Aetna rule: corrected_due = 1st of NEXT service month + 75 days
  - Do NOT use Oracle due date for Aetna — override it
  - Apply Chapter 11 / dispute exclusion flags
  - Apply remittance notice flags (Column T)
  - Apply parent-child entity mappings
  - Compute days_already_overdue for past-due invoices

STEP 4: FEATURE ENGINEERING
  - All 24 features from Section 11
  - Revenue PM growth factor (3–5% applied to last month revenue)
  - NET AR computation: AR + Unbilled - On-Account
  - USD equivalent computation at spot FX rate

STEP 5: MODEL A — PAYMENT DAYS
  - LightGBM Regressor on 3 years training data
  - Special handling: overdue invoices get days_already_overdue feature
  - Holiday calendar post-processing (UK + US + Iceland)
  - Output: predicted_payment_date per invoice

STEP 6: MODEL B — PAYMENT AMOUNT
  - Stage 1: Classify Full / Partial / Dispute / Write-off
  - Stage 2: If Partial → regress on payment_pct
  - Output: predicted_amount = invoice_amount × predicted_pct
  - Liberty example: predicted_pct ≈ 0.85
  - Combined with Model A: date + amount per invoice

STEP 7: ADJUST & STACK
  - Holiday calendar: shift predicted dates to next business day
  - On-account netting: subtract confirmed received amounts
  - Remittance notice: move flagged invoices to "Confirmed Incoming"
  - Unbilled stack: add Model C predictions as lighter green component
  - Spillover detection: flag invoices predicted beyond month-end
  - USD equivalent: convert all currencies at spot rate
  - DSO check: compute implied DSO from forecast, compare to target

STEP 8: OUTPUT
  - Per-invoice: date + amount + confidence + risk tag + action
  - Weekly view (primary) + daily + monthly
  - Treasury table: by entity + currency + USD equivalent
  - DSO check widget
  - Overdue payment date prediction (Day-2 Action 3)
  - Confirmed Incoming section (remittance notices)
  - Spillover report: invoices expected next month
  - Validation mode comparison (during parallel running phase)


